  <prompt>Owner UAT round 12 items O4/W2 and W3. Record: `notes/042-uat-round12-2026-10-08.md`.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE frontend developer on the Office add-in (React 19, Fluent UI v9).</role>
  <goal>Every Find result (similar document, parent record, matching record) is visibly a link that opens its Spaarke record, and the owner knows whether `POST /api/office/todo` applies the restricted-record rule.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      - Task 092 had already wired open handlers (FindView -> FindResultsList -> `openRecord`), gated on `canOpenRecord` + ORG_URL. Rows were borderless `subtle` buttons, which read as plain text; the non-openable fallback even had a border.
      - Part B is investigation only; no server code.
    </background>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="owner O4/W2">Items open their target; without ORG_URL / capability they stay plain (never a broken link).</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-10 / ADR-021">Capability-gated, Fluent v9 tokens, keyboard operable, named buttons, visible focus.</constraint>
    <constraint source="scope">No BFF/server edits; no App.tsx edit needed.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A similar document opens sprk_document/{id}; a matching record opens its entity/id; Enter and Space activate.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Openable rows carry a border, an open glyph and an "Open in Spaarke" tooltip.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Without onOpenRecord nothing is a button.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Gates: full jest green; lint 0; typecheck test-file errors not above 68, 0 production.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Note records the To Do restricted-rule findings with file:line.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step>Check existing wiring; add the affordance; new test file.</step>
    <step>Trace OfficeService.CreateTodoAsync against the platform rules; write the note.</step>
  </steps>

  <justification>
    <existing>Open handlers and gating exist (092); the shared opener is `openRecordLauncher`.</existing>
    <extension>Yes - styling and cue on existing rows only.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Owner UAT round 12: users do not realise Find rows open the record.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

  <relevant-files>
    <file role="edit">src/client/office-addins/shared/taskpane/components/FindResultsList.tsx</file>
    <file role="new">src/client/office-addins/shared/taskpane/components/__tests__/FindResultsList.openAffordance.test.tsx</file>
    <file role="new">projects/spaarkeai-word-add-in-r1/notes/119-find-open-links-and-todo-restriction-check.md</file>
  </relevant-files>

